+## 8. Selective Recovery of Interrupted Repairs (Phase 11)
+
+RouteBudget Lab investigates whether selective recovery of completed replacement routes from interrupted repairs improves final solution quality at a planning deadline compared with ordinary checkpoint resumption alone.
+
+### Evaluated Policies
+1. `RESUMPTION_NO_PA`: Ordinary checkpoint resumption baseline; zero recovery overhead; no terminal reserve.
+2. `PA_EVERY_INTERRUPTION_FILTERED`: Filtered partial acceptance evaluated on every interrupted repair ($U = \sum \max(w_i, 0)$ skips non-improving slices in 14.3 ns).
+3. `PA_EVICTION_ONLY`: Recovery evaluated exclusively when a checkpoint is about to be naturally evicted from the bounded store ($K=2$).
+4. `PA_TERMINAL_ONLY`: Resumption during normal search; bounded recovery during a 2.0 ms monotonic terminal reserve before the global deadline.
+5. `PA_EVICTION_AND_TERMINAL`: Selective recovery on both natural eviction and terminal reserve.
+6. `TERMINAL_RESERVE_CONTROL`: Control ablation stopping normal search 2.0 ms early with zero recovery.
+
+### Build and Verification Commands
+
+```bash
+# Build Release binaries and test suites (10/10 test suites)
+cmake -B build/bench-release -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
+cmake --build build/bench-release -j8
+ctest --test-dir build/bench-release --output-on-failure
+
+# Build Sanitizer suite (AddressSanitizer + UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer)
+cmake -B build/audit-asan -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug -DENABLE_SANITIZERS=ON
+cmake --build build/audit-asan -j8
+ctest --test-dir build/audit-asan --output-on-failure
+```
+
+### Reproduce Matched 192-Run Development Pilot & Statistical Analysis
+
+```bash
+# Execute 192-run balanced sequential pilot across 32 cells (2 maps x 2 scens x 2 scales x 2 budgets x 2 seeds x 6 policies)
+python3 scripts/run_selective_recovery_pilot.py
+
+# Recompute paired Wilcoxon, sign test, filter efficiency, overshoot percentiles, and summary
+python3 scripts/analyze_selective_recovery.py
+```
+
+*Key Documentation:*
+- Formal Design & Prior Art Matrix: `docs/selective_recovery_design.md`
+- Requirements-to-Tests Matrix (22 categories): `docs/requirements_to_tests_matrix.md`
+- Audit & Correction Ledger: `docs/correction_ledger.md`
+- Full Empirical Evaluation Report: `docs/selective_recovery_analysis.md`
+
+---
+
